{"tool_name":"bioconductor-singlecellsignalr","contents":["biocontainers","oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biocontainers":{"name":"bioconductor-singlecellsignalr","identifiers":["doi:10.18129/b9.bioc.singlecellsignalr"],"license":"GPL-3","summary":"Cell Signalling Using Single Cell RNAseq Data Analysis","home_url":"https://bioconductor.org/packages/3.11/bioc/html/SingleCellSignalR.html","keywords":["Clustering"],"manually_check":true,"total_pulls":4},"biotools":{"id":"bioconductor-singlecellsignalr","home":"https://bioconductor.org/packages/SingleCellSignalR","summary":"Inference of ligand-receptor (L-R) interactions from single-cell expression (transcriptomics/proteomics) data. SingleCellSignalR v2 inferences rely on the statistical model we introduced in the BulkSignalR package as well as the original SingleCellSignalR LR-score (both are available). SingleCellSignalR v2 can be regarded as a wrapper to BulkSignalR fundamental classes. This also enables v2 users to work with any species, whereas only Mus musculus & Homo sapiens were available before in SingleCellSignalR v1.","tool_type":["Command-line tool","Library"],"version":["2.2.0"],"collections":["BioConductor"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:bioconductor-singlecellsignalr","credit":[{"name":"Jacques Colinge","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Developer"]},{"name":"Jean-Philippe Villemin","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Maintainer"]}],"documentation":[{"type":["User manual"],"url":"https://bioconductor.org/packages/SingleCellSignalR"}],"name":"SingleCellSignalR","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"bioconductor_import","publication":[{"doi":"10.1093/nar/gkaa183"}]},"bioschemas":{"name":"SingleCellSignalR","home":"https://bio.tools/bioconductor-singlecellsignalr","version":"2.2.0","summary":"Inference of ligand-receptor (L-R) interactions from single-cell expression (transcriptomics/proteomics) data. SingleCellSignalR v2 inferences rely on the statistical model we introduced i